        "verdict": "PASS",
        "reasons": "EXECUTABLE is supported. Three WRITTEN_ACCEPTANCE agreements at $3,200 each ($9,600) are recorded for the opening whose buyers posted requests for quote (2026-11-21), so price and conversion are this buyer's own committed figures and no new sales are needed. Delivery is by the recorded fulfiller, Harbor Wrap Marine Services, at its $1,400-a-marina quote ($4,200 < $9,600; net $5,400), exposure $0 on the card, and the supplier is paid on day 20 when the marinas' payments settle (day 6 invoice + 14 days), so cash never goes negative and $9,600 of settled cash is received by day 20 of 40, clearing the $8,000 received-cash proof condition. Recomputed ledger matches Brain's trace.",
